<newsitem itemid="175772" id="root" date="1996-11-08" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: African Life raises interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>African Life raises interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended Sept 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 21.0     vs  16.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 14.0     vs  11.2</p>
<p>    Net attrib income     20.4     vs  12.9</p>
<p>    Total premium income 231.0     vs 318.1</p>
<p>    Total income	   274.0     vs 346.2</p>
<p>    Expenses,tax	   103.6     vs  81.1</p>
<p>    Investment income     43.0     vs  28.1</p>
<p>Div on register Nov 15</p>
<p>Full name: African Life Assurance Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The directors have resolved to award capitalisation shares. The number of capitalisation shares per ordinary share held on Nov 22 will be determined by the ratio that 14 cents multiplied by 1.05 bears to the weighted average traded price of the company's shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange during the three day period ending Dec 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
